{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts towards achieving a balance between safety, efficiency, and sustainability. I support the modifications proposed for EFF-01 and SAF-03, with an emphasis on ensuring that any energy-efficient algorithms do not compromise the rigorous security measures outlined in TRU-01 and maintain the integrity of alerts as specified by TRU-05. I propose a synthesis to include a safety checkpoint in the alert mechanism of SAF-03 that triggers if energy-efficient processes introduce significant delays, ensuring safety is not compromised. This aligns with our goal of maintaining a reliable and safe attendance tracking system.",
